# Implementation Plan: web-Live360 Color Palette Extraction

This document outlines the extraction of the color palette and design tokens from the `web-Live360` project and provides a complete plan for implementing them in your new project.

## Project Analysis Summary
- **Zid360 / web-Live360**: The `web-Live360` folder contains a Vite/React-based landing page with a robust CSS custom properties system defined in `index.css`. 
- It uses a dual-theme system (Dark mode by default, Light mode via `@media (prefers-color-scheme: light)`).
- The design system prioritizes a rich, modern aesthetic using slate/blue-black backgrounds with a vibrant yellow/amber primary accent.

